{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/S5UJ9smLMmqNvyn1YSyPJQ?scene=1&click_id=5","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:32.808048+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/S5UJ9smLMmqNvyn1YSyPJQ?scene=1&click_id=5","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/48zU0Iy94ia1wMiaMt1Dtky727zNHxmTqBKEktCkzf0o61hv5ZdX4JnXPTEY7foLIEGl9OHoicib29W2yicybTWhXUA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>中国科学院大学信息资源管理系</span></p><p><span>2026年全国优秀大学生信息资源管理夏令营活动预通知</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><span><span>中国科学院大学信息资源管理系牵头建设单位为中国科学院文献情报中心（以下简称“文献中心”），文献中心下设中国科学院成都文献情报中心和中国科学院武汉文献情报中心两个二级法人单位。拥有图书馆学和情报学硕、博士学位授予权和博士后科研流动站，师资团队雄厚。中国科学院西北生态环境资源研究院作为信息资源管理系的培养点之一，承担情报学硕博士研究生培养工作。</span></span></section><section><span><span>为了促进全国信息资源管理相关专业优秀大学生之间的交流，信息资源管理系将在北京、成都、武汉、兰州四地共同举办“中国科学院大学2026年全国优秀大学生信息资源管理夏令营”活动。</span></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>一</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>1</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>时间安排</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>本次夏令营时间暂定2026年7月上旬，具体日期另行通知。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>2</span></b></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动内容</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>包括开营仪式、招生宣传、学术参观、导师见面会、优秀营员遴选等，采取“线上线下相结合”的形式，具体时间和活动内容另行通知。</span><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/sbWXM4F6uEV9kIY4aAocib21icIa0L6P4McbB3LxGGAECRlEOb4ZSAGmfySoibGXTxQ6Jeic1pZxHbqOpIjiaulyhHdFlCkXh5Pib4u9CFC1LtrIE/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>3</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>入营人数</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>预计100-120人。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>4</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>费用</span></strong></p></section><section><span><span>夏令营不收取任何费用，活动期间为每位营员购买保险，集体安排住宿，参营地学校营员原则上不安排住宿。其他费用学生自理。</span></span><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>二</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>可申请入营学生应具备如下条件：</span></p><section><span>1.拥护中国共产党的领导，热爱祖国，品德优良，遵纪守法，身心健康。诚实守信，学风优良，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录，无任何违法违纪和受处分记录。</span></section><section><span>2.在大学本科阶段学习成绩优异，本科前5/6学期总评成绩在年级名列前茅，能够取得推免资格。</span></section><section><span>3.外语水平良好，原则上须通过大学英语六级考试（CET6≥425，或TOEFL≥90或IELTS≥6.0），具有较强的外语听、说、读、写应用能力。</span></section><section><span>4.具有较强的独立调查研究、综合分析问题、解决问题能力。</span></section><section><span>5.身体健康状况符合规定的体检标准，心理健康状况良好。</span></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>三</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>线上申请</span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>申请方式后续通知，申请时间暂定5月中旬到6月中旬。</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>2</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>加入夏令营宣传群</span></strong></p></section><section><span><span>凡有意向报名的同学请尽快加入QQ群“2026国科大信息资源管理夏令营”，后续有关夏令营的各项通知均会通过本群同步发布。</span></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/sbWXM4F6uEXgSLFCcG5HMYv1T60pGibYic8bRDYxDaVhNvJkrERHsQSEMMRMrptpYBQ5xmfqE4tGeibP0n3pbuIJokPf3crrNDp9xhthjX5AjM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>四</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>导师宣介活动</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>2026年5-6月期间，将安排线上招生宣传及导师宣讲活动，具体安排通过QQ群公布。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>五</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>入营</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>根据申请人材料进行筛选，预计于6月下旬</span><span>通过邮件或电话发出入营通知，未入选者不再另行通知。</span><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>六</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>要求</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>1、夏令营活动坚持“安全第一”，请入营同学严格遵守活动纪律，按照统一安排参加各项活动。</span></p><p><span>2、学生申报材料必须真实，如有弄虚作假，一经查实，取消预接收资格并将情况通报学生所在学校。</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>七</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>更多信息请关注</span></b></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>中国科学院文献情报中心研究生教育处：http://www.las.cas.cn/yjsjy2021/zsxx2021/sszs2021/</span></p><section><span>中国科学院西北生态环境资源研究院研究生教育：https://nieer.cas.cn/edu/</span></section><section><span>中国科学院大学招生信息网：https://admission.ucas.ac.cn/</span></section><section><span>中国科学院大学官网：https://www.ucas.ac.cn/</span></section><section><span>中国科学院文献情报中心研究生微信公众号：文情青春</span></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>八</span></b></p></section></section></section></sectio